                <pb facs="0279" n="195" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg195"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Beaupré to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-09-17"><hi rendition="#italic">September 17,
                        1903</hi></date>. (Received 7.30 p.m., 18.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>September 17, 11 a.m. No discussion of canal question and no change in the
                    situation.</p>
                <p>The probability is that Congress will not adjourn before 20th proximo.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
